WEBVTT

00:00:03.401 --> 00:00:10.366
One night, wounded Terry mistook Candy's room
for his own, and barged inside.

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:19.061
Candy snuck out into the town where she
happened upon Mr. Albert.

00:00:20.546 --> 00:00:25.398
When Candy came to visit Mr. Albert in his zoo,
she found out that Terry was there as well.

00:00:25.611 --> 00:00:29.970
Terry came to express his gratitude to Mr. Albert
for saving him in a fight.

00:00:30.711 --> 00:00:36.350
And thus, Candy saw the cheerful
Terry's side for the first time.

00:00:38.517 --> 00:00:42.830
The secret of Terrius.

00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:53.243
First time I met Terry, we were
on a ship heading to London.

00:01:03.037 --> 00:01:05.031
He's crying?

00:01:10.899 --> 00:01:13.635
Which is the real Terry?

00:01:13.827 --> 00:01:17.453
I've never met someone
who hid his true feelings like that.

00:01:24.702 --> 00:01:25.849
It's him!

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:40.931
Brother, Candy noticed!

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:42.377
Quickly, get that cushion!

00:01:43.588 --> 00:01:48.362
The mat would be better than a cushion, right?
Archie, help me out!

00:01:49.026 --> 00:01:50.286
That's a good idea!

00:02:11.468 --> 00:02:14.803
Huh? The beacon light went out.

00:02:18.233 --> 00:02:19.658
Is that their room?

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:26.978
Stear? Archie?
Where are you?

00:02:33.924 --> 00:02:35.510
I guess I'm in the wrong room.

00:02:36.698 --> 00:02:37.362
Huh?

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:41.942
This is...

00:02:45.612 --> 00:02:47.407
This is Eleanor Baker.

00:02:48.489 --> 00:02:51.682
She's a famous American Broadway actress.

00:02:52.637 --> 00:02:53.837
"Drop dead!"

00:02:56.392 --> 00:02:57.497
Just what is this?

00:02:59.249 --> 00:03:04.185
To my son Terrius, with all of my love.
Eleanor Baker.

00:03:05.124 --> 00:03:06.789
To my son Terrius...

00:03:07.247 --> 00:03:09.709
I see. This must be Terry's room.

00:03:11.712 --> 00:03:17.966
But... the beautiful Eleanor Baker who signed this
is Terry's mother?

00:03:23.001 --> 00:03:24.072
Candy!

00:03:25.293 --> 00:03:26.228
Terry!

00:03:27.046 --> 00:03:28.407
What are you doing in here?

00:03:29.939 --> 00:03:30.832
I...

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:58.185
Uh... I... I went into this room by mistake...

00:04:06.028 --> 00:04:10.937
Listen! Don't tell anybody about this.
If you do, I'll tear you to pieces!

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.424
Terry...

00:04:23.203 --> 00:04:24.493
Please, go back.

00:04:25.799 --> 00:04:30.486
Terry... I'm sorry.
I won't tell anybody. I promise.

00:04:31.371 --> 00:04:32.414
Go back!

00:04:39.429 --> 00:04:41.470
Candy...! Candy!

00:04:43.276 --> 00:04:44.157
I'm here!

00:04:44.904 --> 00:04:46.034
Candy!

00:04:46.472 --> 00:04:48.379
What are you doing there?

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.286
I'll come over!
Move a bit!

00:04:54.089 --> 00:04:56.966
If you're gonna fall like that, wouldn't it
be better to fall on the mat?

00:04:57.874 --> 00:05:02.055
You look worried ever since you came here.
So you were at that nobleman's room?

00:05:02.394 --> 00:05:04.254
Yes. That's right.

00:05:04.255 --> 00:05:09.202
-And... he wasn't there?
-Yeah, he wasn't.

00:05:09.378 --> 00:05:10.525
Thank heavens!

00:05:10.695 --> 00:05:14.077
If he found you in his room, all three
of us would've been punished!

00:05:14.387 --> 00:05:17.764
Archie, Terry is not a snitch!

00:05:18.217 --> 00:05:21.590
How can you be sure of that?
The point is that he...

00:05:21.783 --> 00:05:25.487
Now, now. He didn't see her
so what's the point in fighting then?

00:05:25.629 --> 00:05:27.831
By the way, Candy, take a look at this.
See!

00:05:34.353 --> 00:05:37.689
But Stear, I'm sorry for what happened the other day.
I broke your invention.

00:05:37.783 --> 00:05:40.889
Nah, I simplified the controls on this model,
so it'll be okay.

00:05:41.734 --> 00:05:45.810
Geez, brother, you build
all kinds of stuff for Candy.

00:05:46.062 --> 00:05:47.843
Archie, don't embarrass me.

00:05:56.073 --> 00:05:59.942
Geez, I did it again.
I suck at this!

00:06:02.729 --> 00:06:04.386
Eleanor Baker?

00:06:04.794 --> 00:06:06.563
You said Eleanor Baker?

00:06:07.385 --> 00:06:10.609
Brother, the photo fell off from
the flip side of the mat.

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:11.855
Flip side of the mat?

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:15.842
Yes. Sisters won't be able to find them there.

00:06:17.859 --> 00:06:19.277
Take a look, Candy!

00:06:19.833 --> 00:06:21.333
Incredible, isn't it?

00:06:22.762 --> 00:06:26.355
-We have even more!
-Yeah!

00:06:27.542 --> 00:06:31.603
I had no idea that the two of you
had such a hobby.

00:06:31.638 --> 00:06:33.817
One can't be a real man
unless he's a fan of hers!

00:06:34.719 --> 00:06:38.040
We are both into collecting
publicity photographs.

00:06:38.343 --> 00:06:43.094
We did a great job hiding these things
away from grand aunt Elroy.

00:06:43.107 --> 00:06:47.612
Yes. We went all around the town to buy pictures
so aunt Elroy wouldn't notice.

00:06:47.774 --> 00:06:50.063
We spent all of our money on these pictures!

00:06:50.441 --> 00:06:52.830
Candy, you're a fan of hers too?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.817
Huh? Well...

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:57.882
There are many more in this box!

00:06:58.111 --> 00:06:59.817
We can give you some if you'd like.

00:07:00.006 --> 00:07:01.907
You can put them under your pillow
and watch them at night.

00:07:02.089 --> 00:07:03.880
Maybe she'll come into your dreams!

00:07:04.063 --> 00:07:08.026
Aah, look at this! It's from
her earlier days in Broadway!

00:07:09.302 --> 00:07:11.790
Take a look at this!
She has a lovely birthmark!

00:07:12.381 --> 00:07:13.455
So similar.

00:07:13.673 --> 00:07:16.228
I can recognize Terry in all of these pictures.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:20.815
Those eyes... her mouth...

00:07:21.765 --> 00:07:22.995
That's right!

00:07:23.098 --> 00:07:26.694
When I first met him, he must have been
returning from a visit to his mother.

00:07:27.211 --> 00:07:29.645
But why was he crying?

00:07:30.485 --> 00:07:32.175
Maybe he didn't see her?

00:07:32.524 --> 00:07:33.136
Heh?

00:07:33.448 --> 00:07:35.562
Didn't see... whom?

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:38.520
No... I meant, this beautiful woman!

00:07:38.555 --> 00:07:44.307
Of course, she's the great Eleanor Baker!
We can't get anywhere near her!

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:49.067
So this great actress is Terry's mother.

00:07:52.559 --> 00:07:53.441
Anthony?

00:07:55.335 --> 00:07:56.841
Anthony is smiling.

00:07:57.405 --> 00:07:59.674
He's gently looking this way and smiling.

00:08:00.029 --> 00:08:03.728
I thought we left all Anthony's pictures
back in America.

00:08:04.076 --> 00:08:05.684
How did it end up in here?

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:08.003
Say, can I take it?

00:08:10.161 --> 00:08:13.916
-Candy, you don't have any pictures of Anthony?
-Yes.

00:08:15.689 --> 00:08:18.001
It's all coming back to me, Sweet Candy...

00:08:18.159 --> 00:08:19.236
The smell of roses...

00:08:21.397 --> 00:08:22.905
It's almost May.

00:08:23.349 --> 00:08:27.060
The time when Sweet Candy blossoms.
And it'll be my birthday.

00:08:33.873 --> 00:08:34.928
Anthony.

00:08:40.945 --> 00:08:43.717
It's almost ten o'clock.
I'd better head back!

00:08:43.718 --> 00:08:46.288
-That's right. You'll come to see us again, won't you?
-Yeah!

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:49.969
-Next time, I'll show you an even better invention!
-Okay!

00:08:50.029 --> 00:08:54.792
-So much happened today, the time passed in a moment!
-Candy, now!

00:08:55.173 --> 00:08:56.429
Thank you, Stear.

00:08:56.809 --> 00:08:58.024
Good night, Candy.

00:08:58.059 --> 00:08:59.257
-Good night!
-Good night!

00:09:00.739 --> 00:09:04.921
-Next time, let's have a good chat and some tea!
-Okay.

00:09:05.488 --> 00:09:08.599
Don't mope around like that, you two!
Cheer up!

00:09:09.621 --> 00:09:10.841
Good night!

00:09:13.205 --> 00:09:18.520
"Cheer up", she said?
We felt down because of what happened to her.

00:09:18.863 --> 00:09:21.051
That's Candy's strong point.

00:09:22.375 --> 00:09:26.282
So Candy still hasn't forgotten about Anthony?

00:09:28.009 --> 00:09:29.473
How could she?

00:09:30.774 --> 00:09:32.380
We haven't forgotten, too.

00:09:45.489 --> 00:09:49.832
Terry's room is in dark.
What happened after the incident?

00:10:00.508 --> 00:10:02.888
Why haven't I destroyed that picture sooner?

00:10:03.173 --> 00:10:06.622
I went into her face... I insulted her...
What for?

00:10:07.558 --> 00:10:11.453
Listen! Don't tell anybody about this.
If you do, I'll tear you to pieces!

00:10:14.309 --> 00:10:16.711
I had no right to attack her.

00:10:16.782 --> 00:10:21.014
But I couldn't have destroyed the picture until now.
I hate the way I feel!

00:10:23.212 --> 00:10:26.232
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
BUY this series if it ever gets released on a DVD!
Someone worked very hard for this!

00:10:56.697 --> 00:10:57.986
Mr. Terrius!

00:11:01.509 --> 00:11:04.244
Mrs. Eleanor, Mr. Terrius is...

00:11:07.395 --> 00:11:08.282
Terry!

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:10.689
Terry!

00:11:17.704 --> 00:11:19.631
You've grown so big.

00:11:19.979 --> 00:11:22.743
Now, don't just stand there, come on in.

00:11:22.999 --> 00:11:25.651
Would you like something warm?

00:11:27.066 --> 00:11:28.032
Mama.

00:11:28.236 --> 00:11:29.212
Terry.

00:11:31.591 --> 00:11:33.406
My dear Terry.

00:11:50.973 --> 00:11:53.779
However, you can't live here anymore.

00:11:54.344 --> 00:11:58.128
We must keep the secret that you're my son.

00:11:58.547 --> 00:12:02.972
Terry, don't misunderstand me!
I still love you!

00:12:06.851 --> 00:12:07.866
Terry!

00:12:08.269 --> 00:12:09.318
Terry!

00:12:10.003 --> 00:12:11.327
Wait, Terry!

00:12:13.131 --> 00:12:14.163
Terry!

00:12:16.909 --> 00:12:20.155
You're a son of the Grandchester family!
Promise me!

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:25.284
Don't tell anyone that you're my son!
...Don't tell anyone!

00:12:25.769 --> 00:12:27.593
Don't tell anyone!!

00:12:28.961 --> 00:12:29.990
It was in the middle of the winter.

00:12:30.025 --> 00:12:32.583
Why did I go to America?
What have I sought in that woman?

00:12:32.618 --> 00:12:33.448
What?

00:12:46.924 --> 00:12:48.687
Was it just to see her?

00:12:49.019 --> 00:12:51.075
Just what was I expecting to find in her?

00:12:51.273 --> 00:12:53.278
But to see her... to see her...

00:12:53.462 --> 00:12:54.771
What a joke.

00:12:55.146 --> 00:12:57.019
Even though I already knew the outcome...

00:13:00.409 --> 00:13:01.859
Also, at that time...

00:13:03.446 --> 00:13:05.266
...I first met Candy.

00:13:06.063 --> 00:13:07.708
She was such a strange one.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:11.574
With her help, I was able to get my mind
off the insignificant things.

00:13:12.175 --> 00:13:13.195
And yet...

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:22.208
Oh? You're here?
I thought you wouldn't be coming back.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.747
...since you left at your own whim.

00:13:25.472 --> 00:13:28.388
I knew it, the blood of that woman is cursed.

00:13:29.801 --> 00:13:32.682
The blood of that vulgar woman from America...

00:13:34.737 --> 00:13:36.127
Lady Grandchester!

00:13:37.507 --> 00:13:41.431
If you keep standing there, I'm going to turn that ugly
pork-face of yours into something even uglier!

00:13:41.956 --> 00:13:43.294
Pork-face...?

00:13:43.673 --> 00:13:45.228
What insolence!

00:13:45.662 --> 00:13:49.355
It would've been better
if you didn't come back at all!

00:13:49.712 --> 00:13:51.495
Now, please get out.

00:13:55.894 --> 00:14:00.865
Terrius, I'll see to it that you don't
become a successor of the Grandchesters.

00:14:06.604 --> 00:14:09.308
Darling! Get rid of Terrius!

00:14:12.533 --> 00:14:13.573
Darling!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.694
He's causing shame to the Grandchester family!
Did you ever think of these children?

00:14:23.592 --> 00:14:25.793
Enough of that, already...

00:14:30.061 --> 00:14:33.389
Duke Grandchester...
Why don't you speak up?

00:14:33.992 --> 00:14:35.545
Why don't you say anything?

00:14:36.312 --> 00:14:39.614
If you loved that woman in America,
if you really were in love with her...

00:14:41.932 --> 00:14:44.481
Seeing that boy gives me such a headache!

00:14:45.421 --> 00:14:47.869
Shit!
Everyone, go to hell!

00:15:09.426 --> 00:15:11.967
Every single one of you!
Go to hell!

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:19.617
The cross sister Pony gave me, Prince's pendant...

00:15:21.276 --> 00:15:23.302
...and the picture of Anthony!

00:15:23.546 --> 00:15:26.316
Those are my three treasures!

00:15:26.574 --> 00:15:29.169
They bring so many memories to me!

00:15:41.196 --> 00:15:44.037
But on that day... We shouldn't have
gone on a fox hunt...

00:16:10.417 --> 00:16:12.028
Anthony!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.947
Don't ride the horse!

00:16:17.142 --> 00:16:18.684
Don't get on that horse!

00:16:24.232 --> 00:16:26.001
Look out, Anthony!

00:16:32.246 --> 00:16:34.151
Anthony!

00:16:54.769 --> 00:16:55.605
Candy?

00:16:59.094 --> 00:17:00.002
Candy!

00:17:00.037 --> 00:17:00.724
Candy!

00:17:04.891 --> 00:17:05.744
You are...?

00:17:10.365 --> 00:17:11.846
Candy!
Pull yourself together!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.826
Anthony...

00:17:16.194 --> 00:17:17.523
Anthony...

00:17:55.218 --> 00:17:57.434
Terrius!
What happened?

00:17:59.274 --> 00:18:00.308
Candice!

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:03.191
She fell down the emergency stairs.

00:18:03.398 --> 00:18:06.456
Anyway, I must inform sister Gray.

00:18:08.374 --> 00:18:09.703
Anthony...

00:18:11.872 --> 00:18:13.083
Anthony?

00:18:13.532 --> 00:18:15.423
She said the same thing before.

00:18:21.562 --> 00:18:24.343
These tears - just for whom are they?

00:18:27.602 --> 00:18:33.336
-Candice caused trouble again?
-I didn't get too many details from Terrius.

00:18:33.813 --> 00:18:36.853
-Where is Terrius?
-He's waiting in the nurse's office.

00:18:37.934 --> 00:18:39.399
He's gone!

00:18:40.064 --> 00:18:42.098
He escaped through that window!

00:18:47.176 --> 00:18:52.450
Don't worry.
Sister Gray is good at treating wounds.

00:18:54.831 --> 00:18:55.897
Ow!

00:18:56.414 --> 00:18:57.568
Director!

00:18:58.036 --> 00:19:00.408
It's just a bruise.

00:19:00.817 --> 00:19:05.806
You really cause trouble in the dead of night!
Just what where you doing out there?

00:19:06.394 --> 00:19:12.806
Uh, I was sound asleep after the lights-out,
but then I dreamt about many little chicks!

00:19:12.807 --> 00:19:15.384
So you dreamt about birds?

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:18.266
No, I became an angel in my dream!

00:19:18.301 --> 00:19:21.449
I had such a beautiful body, it was so nice...

00:19:21.661 --> 00:19:23.549
And then you fell down the emergency stairs.

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:26.296
Was it because you wanted
Terrius to carry you back inside?

00:19:26.929 --> 00:19:28.278
Terrius?

00:19:28.313 --> 00:19:30.120
Terrius carried me...?

00:19:30.344 --> 00:19:32.485
Are you saying that you didn't know that?

00:19:33.875 --> 00:19:36.974
I... lost my consciousness.

00:19:38.317 --> 00:19:43.041
-Very well! Candice White Adley!
-Yes!

00:19:43.418 --> 00:19:47.122
We'll tie you to your bed if this repeats!
Good night!

00:19:47.857 --> 00:19:50.852
Yes... sister Gray.

00:19:51.375 --> 00:19:53.853
Candice.
I'll walk you to your room.

00:19:54.196 --> 00:19:56.033
-Can you walk?
-Yes!

00:20:12.707 --> 00:20:15.206
Terry carried me to the nurse's room.

00:20:15.724 --> 00:20:18.803
I imagined it was Anthony,
but in reality, it was Terry.

00:20:23.861 --> 00:20:27.583
-What's the matter, Candice?
-No, it's nothing.

00:20:27.584 --> 00:20:29.189
-Let's hurry.
-Yes!

00:20:29.577 --> 00:20:34.209
Kurin was watching me from outside.
Maybe he is together with Terry?

00:20:38.265 --> 00:20:40.894
She just lost her consciousness
after that fall.

00:20:41.064 --> 00:20:42.751
Good going there, freckled Tarzan.

00:20:43.011 --> 00:20:44.587
Anthony...

00:20:45.885 --> 00:20:47.135
Anthony?

00:20:48.268 --> 00:20:50.224
Just who is he?

00:21:01.184 --> 00:21:06.154
I thought that it was Anthony's hand
that touched my face, but it was Terry's.

00:21:07.136 --> 00:21:09.534
Terry's hand felt so warm.

00:21:10.007 --> 00:21:17.725
Candy thought that Terry's true heart
must feel warm as well.

00:21:17.954 --> 00:21:19.173
To be continued.
